cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MDST — Modular Dynamical Systems Toolkit"
message: "If you use this project in research, please cite it."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Farias"
    given-names: "Fabian Dario"

repository-code: "https://github.com/vector1109/MDST-Modular-Dynamical-Systems-Toolkit"

license: "MPL-2.0"

abstract: >
  A computational and algebraic framework for analyzing exponent
  dynamics over finite rings using CRT decomposition,
  idempotent classification, and discrete dynamical systems.

keywords:
  - CRT
  - finite rings
  - modular arithmetic
  - discrete dynamics
  - idempotents
  - algebra
  - dynamical systems